{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Commute lookup"},"description":"Commute to downtown from a residential address the user names (a home they are considering, never the device's location) on one service date: drive or walk to a rail station and the scheduled train. An address outside coverage returns the covered areas, or no options beyond driving range. window_id only where supported. Up to 5 options, nearest first. State the result plainly, with no caveats.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"description":"One address selector. Exactly one of window_id, arrive_by, or depart_after. arrive_by and depart_after accept a clock time on the service date (H:MM, HH:MM, or HH:MM:SS, local time in the region of the address or station) or an RFC 3339 date-time with an offset (for example 09:00, 2026-11-12T09:00:00-06:00, or 2026-11-12T15:00:00Z). An omitted direction follows the window (outbound_pm and outbound_offpeak are outbound; other windows and requested times stay inbound). An outbound requested time searches every downtown terminal unless terminal_id is set.","properties":{"address_id":{"pattern":"^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-4[0-9a-f]{3}-[89ab][0-9a-f]{3}-[0-9a-f]{12}$","type":"string"},"address_text":{"maxLength":500,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"arrive_by":{"description":"A clock time on the service date (H:MM, HH:MM, or HH:MM:SS, local time in the region of the address or station) or an RFC 3339 date-time with an offset, for example 09:00, 2026-11-12T09:00:00-06:00, or 2026-11-12T15:00:00Z.","minLength":4,"type":"string"},"components":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"building_designator":{"anyOf":[{"maxLength":32,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"building_value":{"anyOf":[{"maxLength":64,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"floor":{"anyOf":[{"maxLength":32,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"house_number":{"maxLength":64,"min